# Local runtime state written next to the project. Never a source file, never
# commit it.
# Scoped to the repo root only — an unscoped "data/" also matched src/data/**,
# silently dropping the Instagram source of truth (types.ts, instagram-posts.json)
# at commit time. Confirmed via `git check-ignore -v`.
/data/

# Local design-tooling state. Kept out of the repository on purpose: this is a
# public site, and its contents are an AI coding assistant's working files, not
# part of the product. Everything here is re-installable from
# Carebridge-internal/docs/team/ROUND3-PLAN.md, "Installing Impeccable".
.claude/
.impeccable/

# Impeccable's product/design working files (root only) -- same reasoning as
# above: AI working files, not product source, never committed to this
# public repo.
/PRODUCT.md
/DESIGN.md

# Team working papers -- internal process reports, screenshots and evidence.
# Removed from the public repo once already (cb987f6); ignored here so that
# doesn't have to happen again every round. Preserved outside the repo, same
# as docs/team/** and docs/verify/**.
/reports/
